{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"前段略偏向“自己的需要会不会给对方造成负担”这一具体顾虑，但后续逐渐转向亲密本身的幸福及其无法保证长久的痛楚，没有让这个顾虑取代主线。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S07、S11 更明显地把主线落在对方是否需要自己的陪伴、自己是否愿意一直陪伴对方上，使亲密幸福逐渐偏向被需要和持续陪伴的关系承诺。\",\n    \"相比之下，对眼前亲密时刻本身正在流逝、无法留住的痛楚，表现得不够持续，部分被未来能否继续陪伴的焦虑替代。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 更持续地把正在发生的亲密幸福与它可能消逝的痛楚缠在一起，从当下的甜蜜、舍不得，到享受幸福时仍无法保证未来，始终围绕同一件事展开。Y 也包含这两面，但后半段更容易转向对方是否需要自己、自己能否一直陪伴这一相近但更具体的关系焦虑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1a9f6048-9279-4163-a602-ceffc91e9dbc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T100628312912Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:06:53.739254+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "241ff55ddec75c8d2704baadd93615ae248d4aea2c4fbd256ce1d28147827d2b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment